// This message file contains text to be used in game-supplied notes.
// Only the message line numbers 1000 or higher are valid
// Each new note begins on a multiple of 10, and can use up to 10
// lines, which must be consecutive. Each line appears in the note
// as a paragraph.

{1000}{Tim- 

I've left this note for you, in case you come back for me and I'm... gone. I know you'll come back, I know it... and I want you to know that I love you. Dr. Liebert has taken control of Level 3 now, and now controls all Security functions. I don't know how much I can avoid these robots... everyone else is hiding or dead. Oh god... Tim, I love you...

-Marisa}

{1010}{The robots are hunting us... they're everywhere! I need to sleep, but I can't. They're always searching for us... Liebert's fucking drones. We're pulling out. Goodbye, Deep World...}

{1020}{To whomever:

We're withdrawing from the compound.  Liebert's security bots are hunting us down and picking us off one by one. Leaving Deep 15 is the only option. Perhaps we can survive on the surface... it's can't be worse than in here.}

{1030}{Collette,}
{1031}{Retreat to the Storeroom. Fausta will be waiting for you there along with something that may damage these damned machines.}
{1032}{Wrapped with this note you should find the key to the door. Be careful, it's the only copy we've got now.}
{1033}{Tim}

{1040}{Nathan-}
{1041}{We've got to pull out of Level 1, it's too overrun with drones. I want you to seal some of the unnecessary exits, and try to lock down any ventilation shafts you can- the robots have begun using those to sneak around the Deep World.}
{1042}{Unless the Transit System miraculously starts operating again, the only way out is to fight our way upward, out of Deep 15. See if you can get those explosives from Level 3, and we'll leave that fucker a present on our way out. I'm headed to Level 2 to see if I can find any hazard gear.}
{1043}{Don't worry, in a few days we'll be playing pool and drinking beer in the Arizona sun!}
{1044}{-R. Johnson}

{1050}{To whoever finds this-}
{1051}{Well, shit. I got jabbed pretty hard by one of those spider droids, and I don't think I'm gonna make it.}
{1052}{So I guess this can be my eulogy, of sorts. There's never enough time to say everything you want to...}
{1053}{I'm locking my equipment in the desk in the backroom of the lecture hall. Take it if you like, I'm past need for it. Watch out for the traps, though. Walk to the back room the long way, between the two rows of benches, or you'll be very sorry.}
{1054}{By the way, If you happen to see my granddaughter Amanda, please tell her I love her... Tell her to be careful.} 
{1055}{-R. Johnson}


